  messages:
  - "\u0110\u1EBFn gi\u1EDD c\u01A1m tr\u01B0a r\u1ED3i! V\u1EC1 nh\xE0 \u0103n c\u01A1m
    v\u1EDBi gia \u0111\xECnh thui!!!"
  - "Nh\u01B0ng m\xE0 b\u1EA1n ph\u1EA3i ho\xE0n th\xE0nh nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5 \u0111\xE3
    r\u1ED3i m\u1EDBi \u0103n u\u1ED1ng sau nh\xE1!!!"
  - "H\xE3y x\u1EBFp c\xE1c m\xF3n \u0103n l\xEAn b\xE0n sao cho ph\xF9 h\u1EE3p
    v\u1EDBi s\u1EDF th\xEDch \u0103n u\u1ED1ng c\u1EE7a m\u1ED7i th\xE0nh vi\xEAn
    nh\xE9! M\xF3n th\xE0nh vi\xEAn n\xE0o c\xE0ng kh\xF4ng th\xEDch th\xEC c\xE0ng
    tr\xE1nh xa nh\xE1, c\xF2n th\xEDch th\xEC ng\u01B0\u1EE3c l\u1EA1i thui."
